  "description": "Per-object configuration inside a Data Sync: which source object goes into which UnifyApps object, how it is written, and the field pairs. Fully editable after creation - the running automation reloads this record every run, so a remap needs no redeploy. sourceObject and destinationObject are the exception and are fixed at creation; changing either is a different mapping. Unique on (pipelineId, sourceObject). v1 creates exactly one per sync; the shape and loadSequence are here so v2 multi-object is a UI change.",
